<p id="mwBA"><i id="mwBQ"><b id="mwBg">Rhynchoconger bicoloratus</b></i><sup about="#mwt6" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="./Rhynchoconger_bicoloratus#cite_note-1" id="mwBw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCg">]</span></span></a></sup> is a species of deep-water <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Congridae" title="Congridae" id="mwCw">conger eel</a> native to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Indian_Ocean" title="Indian Ocean" id="mwDA">Indian Ocean</a>. It was described through specimens captured in Kalamukku fishing harbor, off <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Kochi" title="Kochi" id="mwDQ">Kochi</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Arabian_Sea" title="Arabian Sea" id="mwDg">Arabian Sea</a>, from a depth beyond 200 m.<sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="./Rhynchoconger_bicoloratus#cite_note-2" id="mwDw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEQ">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

